ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

This software (GOLI-CLI) is an original TypeScript implementation of an
enterprise AI coding agent. The architecture is informed by the GOLI-CLI
Enterprise AI Coding Agent Roadmap (included in /docs/source-roadmap/).

GOLI-CLI is designed to operate with GLM-5.2 (MIT-licensed, open weights) as
its default backend. It does not derive source code from any closed-weight
vendor SDK. The TUI reference design (Ink + React) is reimplemented from
scratch under the MIT license.

If you redistribute this software, you MUST preserve this copyright notice,
the above permission notice, and the LICENSE file in the repository root.
